					<![CDATA[
						 <div style="text-align: right;"></div> <p><strong>Item #:</strong> SCP-5144</p> <div style="text-align: center;"> <div style="background: url(http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/the-great-hippo/scp_trans.png) center no-repeat; float: center; border: solid 2px #000; padding: 1px 15px; box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.2);"> <h1><span>WARNING: THE FOLLOWING FILE IS LEVEL 3 CLASSIFIED</span></h1> <hr /> <h3><span>ALL ACCESS TO THIS FILE WILL BE NOTIFIED AND TRACKED BY MTF RHO-9 (TECHNICAL SUPPORT).</span></h3> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Show&nbsp;File</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Hide&nbsp;File</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p><strong>Object Class:</strong> Thaumiel</p> <p><strong>Special Containment Procedures (SCP-5144):</strong> Viewing SCP-SCP-5144 is only permitted to Level 3 personnel and above. Any personnel who inscribed symbols similar to SCP-5144 are to be brought for psychological analysis and assessment.<br /> SCP-5144 is to be used only for testing or authorized containment of other SCP’s or disobedient D-class personnel. Symbolic placement of SCP-5144, when authorized, must be always supervised by the site director.<br /> All staff with SCP-5144 are to be monitored, and staff identified with SCP-5144 inscribed on their face are to have SCP-5144 removed if possible, termination is authorized if removal is not possible. Other instances of SCP-5144 inscriptions on inanimate objects are to be held in secure containment with three coded locks and class 04 access.<br /> <strong>Special Containment Procedures (Former Agent Dragnel):</strong> <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">Former Agent Dragnel is to be contained in a standard office. If Former Agent Dragnel attempts to leave without authorization and STF Echo-1 (Puzzle Solvers) accompanying him, the use of prototype MOTE-5g7 is authorized</span> Former Agent Dragnel must be kept in class-5 hibernation pod permanently, brain functions are to be constantly monitored for any anomalous activity. STF Echo-1 (Puzzle solvers) are encouraged to use prototype MOTE-5g7 on Former Agent Dragnel for containment if any escape is attempted</p> <p><strong>Description:</strong> SCP-5144 is a runic symbol consisting of 3 simple curved lines and a dot. If arranged properly SCP-5144 will grant the object or organism that it is inscribed on anomalous abilities, these abilities are determined on the object and placement of SCP-5144.</p> <p>SCP-5144 has been recorded to abnormally improve the attributes of objects and organisms it has been inscribed on if the object holds no anomalous attributes already.<br /> The origin of SCP-5144 was created by Former Agent Dragnel, Former Agent Dragnel is 5.9 feet (1.8 meters) tall with standard human health and masculinity. Former Agent Dragnel is insistent on being the owner of SCP-5144 and classifying it as the Dragnel Rune. Former Agent Dragnel has a personnel attachment with SCP-5144.</p> There are currently 5 staff members and 3 objects with the SCP-5144 inscription.<br /> <span style="text-decoration: underline;">Staff members</span><br /> <table class="wiki-content-table"> <tr> <td>Name</td> <td>SCP-5144 Placement (inscription)</td> <td>Anomalous ability</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Former Agent Dragnel</td> <td>underneath left wrist (Tattoo)/Right temple (scarred)</td> <td>Former Agent Dragnel can manipulate his own anatomical structure and immediate reality, to the cost of his stamina. Physical weaponry has proven unsuccessful. Former Agent Dragnel can also project his mind to others when they are in an unconscious state.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Former Agent Carl</td> <td>left bicep (pen ink drawing)</td> <td>Former Agent Carl has 4 times improved strength, agility, and endurance. No increase in physical muscle mass was made.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Doctor Emily Garcia</td> <td>Right calf (tattoo)</td> <td>Doctor Garcia has increased speed. The highest recorded speed was 58&#160;km/h. However, Doctor Garcia appears to gain more speed with continuous use, and an estimated max speed of 145&#160;km/h is determined.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>D-78565</td> <td>right palm (permanent marker)</td> <td>D-78565 can generate short bursts of napalm from the right hand, this is executed when D-78565 opens her hand. D-78565 appears to have no control of napalm spread is made when the hand in opened</td> </tr> <tr> <td>D-75634</td> <td>left forearm (permanent marker)</td> <td>D-75634 can control and manipulate animals in herds, and packs. This does not include humans or anomalous organisms</td> </tr> <tr> <td><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">D-68465</span></td> <td><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">Forehead (scarred)</span></td> <td>D-68465 was found escaping his cell and killing the staff in the main cafeteria <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">D-68465 can alter the personalities of nearby organisms, as well as the brains functionality and health</span></td> </tr> </table> <span style="text-decoration: underline;">Objects</span><br /> <table class="wiki-content-table"> <tr> <td>Object</td> <td>SCP-5144 Placement(inscription)</td> <td>Anomalous ability</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Crude crossbow</td> <td>Spring clip (engraved)</td> <td>No bolts required as ammunition. SCP-5144 has granted the crossbow manifestation of bolts when the lath is pulled back completely. Upon release, whatever object, or entity the bolt hits will incinerate</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Smoothed diorite stone</td> <td>(carved)</td> <td>When held by any humanoid organism, the stone will grant the user control over natural elements. These most commonly relate to water, oxygen-based substances, stone, and fire.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Clay dragon sculpture</td> <td>forehead (engraved)</td> <td>Warm-blooded organisms within 5 meters of the sculpture will undergo reptilian changes to their body. The intense growth of scales and carnivorous teeth will happen instantly. Cold-blooded organisms are not affected</td> </tr> </table> <div class="blockquote"> <p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>Interview log#1</strong></span><br /> <strong>Interviewed:</strong> Agent Dragnel</p> <p><strong>Interviewer:</strong> Site Director █████</p> <p><strong>Foreword:</strong> Site Director █████ brings Agent Dragnel in to ask him about complaints to the Foundations classification choice of SCP-5144</p> <p><strong>&lt;Begin Log&gt;</strong></p> <p><strong>Site Director █████:</strong> Agent Dragnel, you have been a nuisance lately.</p> <p><strong>Agent Dragnel:</strong> Is that a compliment or an observation?</p> <p><strong>Site Director █████:</strong> It is a reason to question your loyalty to the Foundation.</p> <p><strong>Agent Dragnel:</strong> How so?</p> <p><strong>Site Director █████:</strong> [pauses] What is your goal here Former Agent Dragnel?</p> <p><strong>Agent Dragnel:</strong> No goals, I just like the work.</p> <p><strong>Site Director █████:</strong> [pauses] you have been insisting on reclassifying SCP-5144 to the Dragnel rune, is this correct?</p> <p><strong>Agent Dragnel:</strong> Correct. Will you?</p> <p><strong>Site Director █████:</strong> No.</p> <p><strong>Former Agent Dragnel:</strong> Aw come on director, I discovered it so I think I deserve a little credit.</p> <p><strong>Site Director █████:</strong> We have protocols Agent. If classifying SCP-5144 as it poses any anomalous threat, we will always classify it as SCP-5144.</p> <p><strong>Agent Dragnel:</strong> [unintelligible muttering]</p> <p><strong>Site Director █████:</strong> Excuse me?</p> <p><strong>Agent Dragnel:</strong> Nothing.</p> <p><strong>Site Director █████:</strong> If you want to regain some of the privileges you lost, you will need to follow protocol and follow the Foundations rules. They are there for a reason.</p> <p><strong>Agent Dragnel:</strong> [pauses] Is that so? [draws SCP-5144 into dust on the table]</p> <p><strong>Site Director █████:</strong> Agent Dragnel!</p> <p><strong>Agent Dragnel:</strong> There is no concern here. You now have a table that summons food. Consider it a 'good cop' tactic</p> <p><strong>&lt;End Log&gt;</strong></p> <p><strong>Closing Statement:</strong> SCP-5144 was removed from the table leaving the table back to its non-anomalous state. Agent Dragnel is to undergo psychological analysis and removal of his rank, containment scheduled 2030 hours.</p> </div> <br /> <span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>Test MOTE-4g7</strong></span> <blockquote> <p><strong>Subject:</strong> D-5792</p> <p><strong>Procedure:</strong> Prototype MOTE-4g7 is to be used against D-5792</p> <p><strong>Results:</strong> D-5792’s nervous system has been permanently neutralized.</p> <p><strong>Analysis:</strong> MOTE-4g7 permanently affects the nervous system.</p> </blockquote> <p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>Test MOTE-5g7</strong></span></p> <blockquote> <p><strong>Subject:</strong> D-38585</p> <p><strong>Procedure:</strong> Prototype MOTE-5g7 is to be used against D-38585</p> <p><strong>Results:</strong> D-38585 recovers from nervous system shut-down after 5 days.</p> <p><strong>Analysis:</strong> Prototype MOTE-5g7 is successful at temporarily paralyzing non-anomalous humans.</p> </blockquote> <p><strong>Addendum 1:</strong> Former Agent Dragnel uses SCP-5144 on the coffee cup in his office. This caused the cup to fill with coffee constantly and stay hot. Removal and destruction of the coffee cup were made as requested by the site director.</p> <p><strong>Addendum 2</strong> Former Agent Dragnel uses SCP-5144 on 3 firework rockets, these caused moving images instead of regular firework explosions, mostly consisting of eastern dragons. Former Agent Dragnel was then sent to be removed from SCP-5144, however, this was deemed impossible due to Former Agent Dragnel’s ability. Termination of Former Agent Dragnel is requested and awaiting approval.</p> <div class="blockquote"> <p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>Interview log#2</strong></span><br /> <strong>Interviewed:</strong> Former Agent Dragnel</p> <p><strong>Interviewer:</strong> Site Director █████</p> <p><strong>Foreword:</strong> Former Agent Dragnel is to be questioned about his past actions and discovery of SCP-5144</p> <p><strong>&lt;Begin Log&gt;</strong></p> <p><strong>Site Director █████:</strong> This is getting out of hand Dragnel.</p> <p><strong>Former Agent Dragnel:</strong> I beg your pardon?</p> <p><strong>Site Director █████:</strong> You have been using SCP-5144 excessively</p> <p><strong>Former Agent Dragnel:</strong> It’s my rune sir.</p> <p><strong>Site Director █████:</strong> SCP-5144 does not belong to you Dragnel, it is to be properly contained. Do I need to remind you of when you can use SCP-5144?</p> <p><strong>Former Agent Dragnel:</strong> No sir, I already know.</p> <p><strong>Site Director █████:</strong> [sighs] By what means did you discover SCP-5144?</p> <p><strong>Former Agent Dragnel:</strong> That’s a good question. I subconsciously drew it on some paper.</p> <p><strong>Site Director █████:</strong> It just happened?</p> <p><strong>Former Agent Dragnel:</strong> Yes sir</p> <p><strong>Site Director █████:</strong> What did you do afterward?</p> <p><strong>Former Agent Dragnel:</strong> I saw that it gave the paper powers. It folded itself into a paper airplane and flew. So, I got myself a tattoo.</p> <p><strong>Site Director █████:</strong> You didn’t think to tell us before exposing yourself to SCP-5144?</p> <p><strong>Former Agent Dragnel:</strong> Not particularly, if Doctor Charlie didn’t see me using it then you wouldn’t have the Dragnel rune now would you? Can I talk to Doctor Charlie?</p> <p><strong>Site Director █████:</strong> Classify SCP-5144 as it’s supposed to be Dragnel.</p> <p><strong>Former Agent Dragnel:</strong> I did, Dragnel Rune. Can I talk to Charlie?</p> <p><strong>Site Director █████:</strong> No, that's not possible.</p> <p><strong>Former Agent Dragnel:</strong> I own the Dragnel rune.</p> <p><strong>Site Director █████:</strong> You don’t own it, and you must not use it freely either. If you wish to use it, it must be under testing procedures and my supervision. This isn’t under debate Dragnel, this is an order.</p> <p><strong>&lt;End Log&gt;</strong></p> <p><strong>Closing Statement:</strong> Former Agent Dragnel is to be kept in his <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">containment office</span> containment pod.</p> </div> <p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>Test J</strong></span></p> <blockquote> <p><strong>Subject:</strong> SCP-5144 is to be temporarily drawn onto <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-4047">SCP-4047</a></p> <p><strong>Procedure:</strong> SCP-5144 is drawn onto <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-4047">SCP-4047</a> with a washable marker on the right forearm. Observations for additional anomalous activity is conducted.</p> <p><strong>Results:</strong> No extra or improved abilities made, <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-4047">SCP-4047</a></p> <p><strong>Analysis:</strong> SCP-5144 did not give <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-4047">SCP-4047</a> any additional or improved abilities.</p> </blockquote> <p><strong>Addendum 3:</strong> Reports of civilians who have also been using SCP-5144 are being investigated.</p> <strong>Addendum 4:</strong> Three civilians have been brought into custody for the use of SCP-5144.<br /> <table class="wiki-content-table"> <tr> <td>Name</td> <td>SCP-5144 placement (inscription)</td> <td>Anomalous ability</td> </tr> <tr> <td>George Smith</td> <td>Throat (scarred)</td> <td>George Smith can speak all world languages world-wide; this also includes non-human languages and other forms of communication through any organism including plantation</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Grace Smith</td> <td>Right index finger (scarred)</td> <td>Grace Smith has a severe loss in the tip of her index finger leaving the bone to be visible, this bone is oddly sharp and capable of carving into any surface. All carvings will emit a red glow, the point of this is unknown</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Jonathan Conduit</td> <td>Back of left hand (whiteboard marker)</td> <td>Jonathan Conduit can manifest forms of; quote: Shields of energy. This is made up of an unknown matter and can shield Jonathan from all forms of harmful objects.</td> </tr> </table> <div class="blockquote"> <p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>Interview log#3</strong></span><br /> <strong>Interviewed:</strong> George Smith, Grace Smith, Jonathan Conduit</p> <p><strong>Interviewer:</strong> Agent ████</p> <p><strong>Foreword:</strong> Agent ████ is to question each civilian one by one about how they received the information to use SCP-5144</p> <p><strong>&lt;Begin Log&gt;</strong></p> <p><strong>Agent ████:</strong> How are you, Miss Smith?</p> <p><strong>Grace Smith:</strong> Where am I?</p> <p><strong>Agent ████:</strong> Don’t be scared, I just want to ask you a few questions.</p> <p><strong>Grace Smith:</strong> I want a lawyer.</p> <p><strong>Agent ████:</strong> I’m afraid that’s not possible.</p> <p><strong>Grace Smith:</strong> I know my rights, I want a lawyer.</p> <p><strong>Agent ████:</strong> How did you get that symbol on your finger?</p> <p><strong>Grace Smith:</strong> I’m not talking without a lawyer.</p> <p><strong>Agent ████:</strong> [sighs] As I said, we can’t get you a lawyer.</p> <p><strong>Grace Smith:</strong> Why the hell not?</p> <p><strong>Agent ████:</strong> Miss Smith, you are inside a military base because of a symbol on your finger.</p> <p><strong>Grace Smith:</strong> [Silence]</p> <p><strong>Agent ████:</strong> How did you get the symbol?</p> <p><strong>Grace Smith:</strong> In my dreams. A guy in a skull mask gave me the idea to cut the rune into my finger. He had a name for it, I think it was dragon rune, Dragnel rune?</p> <p><strong>Agent ████:</strong> I see. You are free to go now, Miss Grace.</p> <p><strong>Grace Smith:</strong> [exits room]</p> <hr /> <p><strong>George Smith:</strong> [enters room]</p> <p><strong>Agent ████:</strong> Let’s get started shall we?</p> <p><strong>George Smith:</strong> I want a lawyer.</p> <p><strong>Agent ████:</strong> How did you get the idea of that symbol?</p> <p><strong>George Smith:</strong> A dream, a guy told me to do it with a hot iron. I honestly don’t remember me doing it but I did. Now I can talk to animals.</p> <p><strong>Agent ████:</strong> Thank you, Mr. Smith, you may leave.</p> <p><strong>George Smith:</strong> Really? Just like that? [exits room]</p> <hr /> <p><strong>Jonathan Conduit:</strong> [enters the room]</p> <p><strong>Agent ████:</strong> I’d just like to ask a question. Please sit down.</p> <p><strong>Jonathan Conduit:</strong> No, I’ll stand.</p> <p><strong>Agent ████:</strong> ok, how did you get that symbol on your hand?</p> <p><strong>Jonathan Conduit:</strong> [Silence]</p> <p><strong>Agent ████:</strong> Mr. Conduit, we are trying to understand the symbol. To do so, I need your full cooperation.</p> <p><strong>Jonathan Conduit:</strong> The Smiths showed me, I drew it on myself before I was gonna scar myself. Needed to know it worked before branding myself.</p> <p><strong>Agent ████:</strong> Ok, did you experience any dreams about a man in a skull mask?</p> <p><strong>Jonathan Conduit:</strong> No, only the Smiths got those.</p> <p><strong>Agent ████:</strong> Thank you, Jonathan.</p> <p><strong>&lt;End Log&gt;</strong></p> <p><strong>Closing Statement:</strong> Former Agent Dragnel is charged with reaching out to the two civilians and exposing SCP-5144 to them and risk exposure to the world. A deeper investigation into SCP-5144 sightings worldwide is being conducted.</p> </div> <p><strong>Addendum 5:</strong> Discovery of a cult was made relating to SCP-5144 at the time: 1547 date: 12/01/██. This cult is consisted of over 10 members, several groups are predicted across Australia and Russia. Each cultist has received an inscription of SCP-5144 on themselves, the placement of SCP-5144 on each cultist determines their rank amongst the cult.</p> </div> </div> </div> <div class="footer-wikiwalk-nav"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p>&#171; <a class="newpage" href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-scp-5144w">SCP-SCP-5144W</a> | SCP-SCP-5144X | <a class="newpage" href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-scp-5144y">SCP-SCP-5144Y</a> &#187;</p> </div> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/agent-dragnel" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6581177&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609556997" alt="Agent Dragnel" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6581177)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/agent-dragnel" >Agent Dragnel</a></span></p> 
				 	]]>
