						 <div style="text-align: right;"></div> <div class="scp-image-block block-right" style="width:WIDTH-GOES-HERE;"><img src="https://www.velvetblues.com/wp-content/uploads/hourglass.jpg" style="width:WIDTH-GOES-HERE;" alt="hourglass.jpg" class="image" /> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:WIDTH-GOES-HERE;"> <p>Object in its Containment Chamber, placed in the middle of a brown wooden table</p> </div> </div> <p><strong>Item #:</strong> SCP-5978</p> <p><strong>Object Class:</strong> Safe</p> <p><strong>Special Containment Procedures:</strong> SCP-5978 is to be kept in a steel containment chamber, and placed in the exact middle of a brown wooden table. The steel chamber must include thick padding on the walls, to prevent SCP-5978's anomalous effects. Personnel of Level 4 or higher are granted access to the containment chamber. Personnel recontaining SCP-5978 are not to travel more than 1 foot every second, doing so will result in hallucinations and paranormal activity in persons within a 100 foot radius.</p> <p><strong>Description:</strong> SCP-5978 is a hourglass, standing 9.5 inches tall and has a 6-inch base. Around the glass, consists of golden swirly bars that protect the hourglass from breaking.</p> <p>Any and all humans who come into contact with, physically touch, remain around, or until all sand grains reach the bottom of SCP-5978, will begin experiencing hallucinations, and paranormal activity. Shortly after, persons will begin to feel the urge to break the hourglass. Upon that effect, the human is now designated 'SCP-5978-A'.</p> <p>If the attempt to break SCP-5978 by SCP-5978-A is successful, two events have a possibility of occurring.</p> <p><strong>Event #1:</strong> The sands of time will stop immediately after the breakage of SCP-5978, freezing the universe entirely. Any attempts to revert this have not been made, as it is not possible.</p> <p><strong>Event #2:</strong> SCP-5978-A will have full control over the sands of time upon breakage of SCP-5978. Any events upon their request will be made.</p> <div class="footer-wikiwalk-nav"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p>&#171; <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5977">SCP-5977</a> | SCP-5978 | <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5979">SCP-5979</a> &#187;</p> </div> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/agent-clovin" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7184380&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609556998" alt="Agent Clovin" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7184380)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/agent-clovin" >Agent Clovin</a></span></p> 
