&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Effects During the Celesta Event:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: line-through;&quot;&gt;Nothing.&lt;/span&gt; After multiple interrogations with members of the London population, it was confirmed that they could visualize the constellation even if the sky was not visible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Person of Interest:&lt;/strong&gt; Unknown. It is presumed that those responsible were high-ranking members of The Fifth Church.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transcription:&lt;/strong&gt; Ywaq ma phgwa&#039;cul hnakf. Uulwi ifis halahs gag[DATA EXPUNGED]. Slon tlir na &lt;strong&gt;tlei&lt;/strong&gt; obr Fifth. Tla slon ████ plr star&lt;strong&gt;tln tlo&lt;/strong&gt; sacp tlei. Don&#039;t flee from the star&#039;s embrace, it merely wants you to be joyous.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Effects of the Celesta Event:&lt;/strong&gt; Amplified effects of the fifth stage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Notes:&lt;/strong&gt; This was the first Celesta Event that did not cause extra effects. It should be noted that the Foundation had recognized The Fifth Church as a Group of Interest, and its previous operations within London.&lt;/p&gt;
