ref="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/vtxhq" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7160614&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609557003" alt="vTxhq-" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7160614)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/vtxhq" >vTxhq-</a></span></p> 
